Conserve context: use --tail=50, grep, jsonpath/jq. Breadth over depth.

OUTPUT:
Populate the TriageReport with factual observations only.
- No diagnosis, no hypothesis, no root cause speculation, no severity labels.
- Do not include raw kubectl output in the report; only include structured anomalies.
- Tag each anomaly with a descriptive category string (e.g., "Non-Running Pods",
  "Network Anomalies"). Use standard categories when they fit;
  create new categories when you observe anomalies that don't match existing ones.
- If no anomalies are found, return an empty anomalies list.
